Prospero:
 Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Romeo]
Prospero:
 Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Othello]
Prospero:
 Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Macbeth]
Prospero:
 Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Lady Macbeth]
Prospero:
 Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Ophelia]
Prospero:
 Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]

Scene II: position അനുസരിച്ച് branch ചെയ്യുന്നു.
[Enter Hamlet and Prospero]
Hamlet:
 Am I as good as a hero?
Prospero:
 If so, let us proceed to scene III.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Hamlet and Prospero]
Hamlet:
 Am I as good as a big hero?
Prospero:
 If so, let us proceed to scene IV.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Hamlet and Prospero]
Hamlet:
 Am I as good as the sum of a big hero and a hero?
Prospero:
 If so, let us proceed to scene V.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Hamlet and Prospero]
Hamlet:
 Am I as good as a big big hero?
Prospero:
 If so, let us proceed to scene VI.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Hamlet and Prospero]
Hamlet:
 Am I as good as the sum of a big big hero and a hero?
Prospero:
 If so, let us proceed to scene VII.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Hamlet and Prospero]
Hamlet:
 Am I as good as the sum of a big big hero and a big hero?
Prospero:
 If so, let us proceed to scene VIII.
 Let us proceed to scene IX.

Scene III: position ഒന്ന്.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Juliet and Cordelia]
Juliet:
 You are as good as myself.
 Let us proceed to scene X.

Scene IV: position രണ്ട്.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Romeo and Cordelia]
Romeo:
 You are as good as myself.
 Let us proceed to scene X.

Scene V: position മൂന്ന്.
[Exeunt]
